[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11760.309, "timestamp": "03:16:00", "text": "如果我看了那个价格，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11763.07, "timestamp": "03:16:03", "text": "已经拒绝了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11766.469, "timestamp": "03:16:06", "text": "开头就像，好的，谢谢。再见"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11769.429, "timestamp": "03:16:09", "text": "之后。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11772.469, "timestamp": "03:16:12", "text": "嗯，我看不出有什么理由可以证明这是合理的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11774.469, "timestamp": "03:16:14", "text": "或许你比任何人都做得更好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11776.63, "timestamp": "03:16:16", "text": "因为你知道，你可能知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11778.63, "timestamp": "03:16:18", "text": "比我强多了。我 我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11780.87, "timestamp": "03:16:20", "text": "从这个意义上讲，他是无知的。我无知。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11783.91, "timestamp": "03:16:23", "text": "不，是操。只是，嗯……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11787.269, "timestamp": "03:16:27", "text": "只是，嗯，我真的很喜欢这个模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11790.07, "timestamp": "03:16:30", "text": "我不想让他们把它放进去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11792.63, "timestamp": "03:16:32", "text": "扔进垃圾桶，然后就忘了它。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11795.83, "timestamp": "03:16:35", "text": "我无法原谅这件事，因为我确实这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11798.55, "timestamp": "03:16:38", "text": "和其他人坐下来，表现得像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11802.229, "timestamp": "03:16:42", "text": "一个好人。是的。我当时就觉得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11804.71, "timestamp": "03:16:44", "text": "即使要花我三四个小时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11807.99, "timestamp": "03:16:47", "text": "多年后，他变成了一个坏人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11809.75, "timestamp": "03:16:49", "text": "是的。即使需要四五个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11811.51, "timestamp": "03:16:51", "text": "我花了数年时间才推出这款车型，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11814.15, "timestamp": "03:16:54", "text": "只要我能做到，我就没意见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11819.19, "timestamp": "03:16:59", "text": "用它之类的，因为是的。我嗯，我的意思是"}]